    "note": "Paired values denote the IMQ and untreated control groups, respectively. A dash indicates that no sampling was scheduled for that group at that time. IMQ blood was collected at weeks 0, 4 and 8, and control blood at weeks 0 and 8. All endpoint tissues were collected at week 8, with five mice per group and ten tissues per mouse. The study yielded 25 blood specimens and 100 tissue specimens. Separate TCR and BCR libraries were prepared for each specimen, giving 250 libraries."
